# Per-directory attributes owned by M115, and the only ones this milestone may declare.
#
# The reasoning is M113's and is not restated: every other attributes file in this repository is
# already **bound apparatus of a frozen protocol** -- the root file by M105 and M106, and
# metamorphosis/, scripts/ and tests/ by M107, which created them precisely to stop later milestones
# editing the root. Appending to any of them rebinds a freeze this milestone may not touch, and
# git reads one filename per directory, so there is no fourth place to put an entry.
#
# What composes across freezes is a **declared digest mode**, not an attributes entry:
# `m113_carrier_bank.TESTED_SYSTEM_DIGEST_MODES`, which M115 inherits by importing the mechanism
# rather than copying it, marks every bound source member `lf_normalized`. So no member outside this
# directory needs an attribute at all, and this file covers only what lives here.
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.json -text
